      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → BytePlus → BytePlus settings**.\n2. In the ModelArk console, open **Playground**, choose Seedance 2.5, and open the **Digital characters** tab. Open a character, copy its asset ID, and paste it into **url** on **Reference: Add** in **Character**.\n3. Describe the product in **Product** and the shot in **Scene**.\n4. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/byteplus`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
